WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.122
Think areas, not promises. Support is an

2
00:00:03.122 --> 00:00:06.100
area where buying previously slowed a fall.

3
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.920
Resistance is where selling slowed a rise.

4
00:00:09.333 --> 00:00:12.846
Notice repeated reactions. If price repeatedly turns

5
00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:16.091
near $100 or $110,

6
00:00:16.091 --> 00:00:18.069
mark those areas to study.

7
00:00:18.468 --> 00:00:20.925
A level can break. A past reaction

8
00:00:20.925 --> 00:00:23.771
does not guarantee another. Price can move through

9
00:00:23.771 --> 00:00:24.860
either area.

10
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:28.206
Check the wider picture. Compare the trend

11
00:00:28.206 --> 00:00:30.856
and timeframe. A chart pattern alone is

12
00:00:30.856 --> 00:00:32.477
not a reason to enter.

13
00:00:32.885 --> 00:00:36.204
Practice a decision. In the Chart lab, describe

14
00:00:36.204 --> 00:00:38.065
what you see and plan a possible

15
00:00:38.065 --> 00:00:40.122
loss before choosing an entry.

